        "Run `bun run compliance` from typescript/packages/adapters/arktype/",
        "unevaluatedProperties/unevaluatedItems standalone tests pass",
        "No regressions in other tests",
        "`bun run typecheck` passes"
      ],
      "passes": true,
      "notes": "Compliance: 99.9% (969 passed draft2020-12, 955 passed draft2019-09, 1 failed per draft, 339 unsupported). Updated renderObject to handle unevaluatedProperties when additionalProperties not explicitly set. Updated renderArray to handle standalone unevaluatedItems. Updated renderTuple to handle unevaluatedItems as rest constraint. Only 1 failure per draft: cyclic $ref with unevaluatedProperties - same edge case as zod."
    },
    {
